  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GIE TLM Horticulture Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The producers of the GIE Takku Liggey de Mboro mainly expressed needs in terms of funds to purchase inputs especially seeds. The union needs infrastructures such as storage facilities. They also expressed a need for materials such as tractors and solar kits. The GIE needs digitalization of the office and databases and the SmartAgri software. Their old truck needs fixing or to be changed, and purchase tricycles. Members need motor pumps for irrigation water in their parcels. The executive team need training in good agricultural practice, organizational management et commercialization.</narrative>
  </description>
